        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy has a nanocrystalline fcc matrix.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy has a high density of grain boundaries.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy has a balanced elemental distribution designed for high strength and fatigue performance.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain boundaries in the nanocrystalline microstructure act as fast diffusion pathways for Al.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidizing high-temperature exposure accelerates outward Al diffusion along grain boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain-boundary-assisted Al diffusion rapidly forms a continuous Al2O3 inner layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense, continuous, adherent protective oxide scale limits oxygen and metal-cation transport and therefore slows further oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of the continuous Al2O3 inner layer preserves the target alloy's mechanical integrity.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under reducing conditions, Al oxidation is slower or incomplete and the oxide scale is less continuous.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure causes localized Al depletion near grain boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized Al depletion under reducing exposure produces grain-boundary internal oxidation and microstructural damage.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The internal oxidation and microstructural damage under reducing exposure diminish ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidizing exposure will produce a thin, continuous, adherent Al2O3 inner layer with minimal internal oxidation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::024::3_6_high_temperature_oxidation_mechanism"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure will produce a discontinuous or thicker scale and localized internal oxidation along grain boundaries.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure will cause earlier embrittlement or reduced fatigue performance than oxidizing exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
